
---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Finavit Journal"
  description="Learn how Finavit Journal handles information, privacy, cookies, and third-party services."
>
  <section class="policy-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">YOUR PRIVACY MATTERS</span>
    <h1>Privacy <em>Policy.</em></h1>
    <p>How Finavit Journal handles information when you visit our website.</p>
    <span class="updated">Last updated: November 16, 2026</span>
  </section>

  <article class="policy-content">
    <p>
      Finavit Journal ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy.
      This Privacy Policy explains what information may be processed
      when you visit our blog and how we handle it.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      Finavit Journal is an informational website. Currently, visitors
      can browse our articles without creating an account or submitting
      personal information through registration forms.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not currently operate email signup forms, comment systems,
      or analytics and advertising tracking tools on this blog.
    </p>
    <p>
      Like most websites, our hosting infrastructure may automatically
      process basic technical information when you visit, such as your
      IP address, browser type, device information, requested pages,
      and access timestamps. This information may appear in server logs
      used for website operation, security, and troubleshooting.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      We do not currently use analytics or advertising cookies on
      Finavit Journal. Our website may use technical mechanisms
      necessary for normal operation, depending on the hosting
      infrastructure and services involved.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Our website loads fonts from Google Fonts to display its
      typography. When your browser requests these fonts, Google may
      receive technical information associated with that request,
      such as your IP address.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can learn more about Google's privacy practices at
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Google's Privacy Policy
      </a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our articles may also link to external websites and resources.
      We do not control the privacy practices of those third-party
      websites. We encourage you to review their policies.
    </p>

    <h2>4. The Finavit Platform Is Separate</h2>
    <p>
      Finavit Journal and the main Finavit platform are separate
      experiences. If you visit or create an account on the main
      platform, its own Privacy Policy applies to the information
      processed through those services.
    </p>
    <p>
      Depending on how you use the platform, this may include account
      details, health profile information you choose to provide,
      health goals, and interactions with its features.
    </p>
    <p>
      To learn more about Finavit, visit
      <a href="https://finavit.com">finavit.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable steps to maintain the security and proper
      operation of Finavit Journal. However, no website or method
      of electronic transmission can be guaranteed to be completely
      secure.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have
      rights concerning personal information processed about you,
      including rights to access, correct, or request deletion of
      certain information.
    </p>
    <p>
      For privacy-related questions or requests concerning this blog,
      contact us using the email address below.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Finavit Journal is not intended to knowingly collect personal
      information from children through this website. If you believe
      that a child has provided personal information to us, please
      contact us so we can review the matter.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy as the website develops or
      our practices change. Any updates will be published on this
      page, together with a revised update date.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how
      information is handled on Finavit Journal, contact:
    </p>
    <p class="contact">
      <strong>Email:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:privacy@finavit.com">privacy@finavit.com</a>
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
      This policy describes the current Finavit Journal website.
      If we introduce advertising, analytics, email subscriptions,
      or additional third-party services, we will review and update
      this policy accordingly.
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-hero {
    padding: 85px 24px 65px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #f0f2e9;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #68806d;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .policy-hero h1 {
    margin: 22px 0 14px;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 66px);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .policy-hero h1 em {
    color: #52745a;
  }

  .policy-hero p {
    color: #68736a;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .updated {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: #849087;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .policy-content {
    max-width: 790px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 65px 24px 85px;
  }

  .policy-content h2 {
    margin: 42px 0 13px;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .policy-content p {
    color: #68736a;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .policy-content a {
    color: #315e42;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .contact {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e8df;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fdfdf9;
  }

  .notice {
    margin-top: 45px;
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid #52745a;
    background: #f0f2e9;
    color: #68736a;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
